@game
# en: Lumenhold Academy
title [fceae1] = 流明堡学院
# en: Four years. Forty-eight moons. One apprentice.
subtitle [e1da8c] = 四年。四十八轮月。一名学徒。
# en: The sky-barge lurches. Below, the lake glitters; above, the seven towers of Lumenhold Academy pierce the clouds. You have a trunk, a borrowed wand and a letter of acceptance with your name spelled wrong. Four years begin now.
intro [2dd4dc] = 天空驳船猛地一晃。脚下，湖面波光粼粼；头顶，流明堡学院的七座高塔刺破云层。你有一只行李箱、一根借来的魔杖，还有一封把你名字拼错的录取信。四年，就从此刻开始。
# en: Harvestmoon
month.1 [39637f] = 丰收月
# en: Emberwane
month.2 [293c65] = 烬落月
# en: Mistveil
month.3 [82c3ac] = 雾纱月
# en: Frostcall
month.4 [dbae91] = 霜唤月
# en: Deepwinter
month.5 [668c02] = 深冬月
# en: Thawmoon
month.6 [0fe880] = 融雪月
# en: Stormbloom
month.7 [58f0f1] = 风暴月
# en: Greenrise
month.8 [d3ee01] = 青苏月
# en: Blossomtide
month.9 [dab8ca] = 花潮月
# en: Highsun
month.10 [c6ab59] = 盛阳月
# en: Goldenhaze
month.11 [886cae] = 金霭月
# en: Starfall
month.12 [ab87b4] = 星坠月

@resource health
# en: Health
name [6145af] = 健康
# en: Your body. At zero you collapse.
desc [a87509] = 你的身体。归零时，你会倒下。

@resource mood
# en: Mood
name [64551e] = 心情
# en: Your spirits. At zero, despair takes hold.
desc [ca3154] = 你的精神。归零时，绝望会将你吞没。

@resource mana
# en: Mana
name [78ad2a] = 法力
# en: The magic you can spend on spells. Refills each month, faster the stronger your Arcana.
desc [738cd1] = 你能用来施咒的魔法。每月恢复，奥术越强恢复越快。

@resource renown
# en: Renown
name [996fb2] = 声望
# en: How much the academy talks about you — for better or worse. Fades a little every month.
desc [e64a8d] = 学院里有多少人在谈论你——无论好坏。每个月都会淡去一点。

@resource alignment
# en: Alignment
name [6abafe] = 立场
# en: Lumen or Hollow: the light you serve, or the dark that has noticed you. Deep in the Hollow, the way back is slow.
desc [6e8e70] = 光明或空洞：你所侍奉的光，或已经注意到你的黑暗。在空洞中陷得越深，回来的路就越慢。

@resource gold
# en: Crowns
name [a78479] = 金币
# en: Crowns in your purse. Rent is due every month.
desc [cf79f6] = 钱袋里的克朗。每个月都要交房租。

@skill arcana
# en: Arcana
name [6f1c33] = 奥术
# en: Raw spellcraft — power, control, nerve.
desc [0428ad] = 纯粹的施法功力——力量、控制与胆量。

@skill lore
# en: Lore
name [d907ad] = 学识
# en: Scholarship, theory, history, languages of the old world.
desc [5aadaa] = 学问、理论、历史，以及古老世界的语言。

@skill alchemy
# en: Alchemy
name [5d01fc] = 炼金
# en: Potions, herbs, reagents and the patience to stir clockwise.
desc [dbde44] = 药剂、草药、试剂，以及顺时针搅拌的耐心。

@skill charm
# en: Charm
name [df43f0] = 魅力
# en: Wit, warmth, persuasion. Making people want to say yes.
desc [e1c3b8] = 机智、温暖与说服力。让别人心甘情愿地点头。

@skill vigor
# en: Vigor
name [6c0ee4] = 体魄
# en: Stamina, reflexes, dueling and broom-flight.
desc [9f1acb] = 耐力、反应、决斗和飞帚。

@skill guile
# en: Guile
name [987273] = 诡计
# en: Sneaking, lying, noticing what others miss.
desc [fe3ade] = 潜行、撒谎，以及注意到别人忽略的东西。

@hook rent
# en: Dormitory & board
label [547aba] = 宿舍与膳食
# en: {board_missed == 0: {~The bursar takes the board money with a nod and a tick in a very large book.|Board paid: a bed, three meals and the right to complain about both.|You pay the board and count what's left twice.}|{~The board went unpaid. The refectory still feeds you, a little less each day.|No board money this month. Lunch is a pocketed roll.|Board unpaid again. Your name in the bursar's very large book is underlined now.}}
do.say.1 [4a967f] = {board_missed == 0: {~财务官收下食宿费，点一点头，在一本非常厚的账簿上打了个勾。|食宿费付清了：一张床、一日三餐，外加抱怨这两样的权利。|你付了食宿费，把剩下的钱数了两遍。}|{~食宿费没交上。膳堂照样给你饭吃，只是一天比一天少。|这个月交不起食宿费。午饭是一个揣在兜里的面包。|食宿费又没交。财务主管那本大得出奇的账簿上，你的名字底下画了线。}}

@hook break_rent
# en: Board at the castle
label [0b2949] = 城堡食宿
# en: {~The castle in the holidays still wants its board.|A bed in an empty dormitory costs the same as a full one.}
do.say.1 [5ac98d] = {~假期里的城堡，照样要收食宿费。|空荡荡的宿舍里一张床，和住满时一个价。}

@hook tuition
# en: Tuition
label [7ee27b] = 学费
# en: {~Term fees, paid at a window with a very small grille.|The bursar's quill scratches. Another term is paid for.}
do.say.1 [4595be] = {~学期费交在一个铁栅格小得可怜的窗口。|财务官的羽毛笔沙沙作响。又一个学期付清了。}

@hook course_fees
# en: Course fees
label [f462c1] = 课程费
# en: {~Course fees, paid at the registrar's window with the tuition.|The registrar takes the course fees with a sigh, as if it pained her too.}
do.say.1 [f8b592] = {~课程费和学费一起，在教务处的窗口交清。|教务员收下课程费时叹了口气，仿佛她也心疼。}

@hook gpa_probation
# en: Academic probation
label [5ecefe] = 学业察看

@hook term_stress
# en: Term-time pressure
label [0e2de2] = 学期压力
# en: {month == 4 or month == 10: {~Exams are coming, and everybody's quill moves faster.|The library stays open late and is full until it closes.|You dream of an exam you haven't revised for, which is most of them.}|{~Essays stack up on your desk like weather coming in.|Lectures, reading, more reading. Term has a weight of its own.|Everyone is behind. Everyone says so in the corridors.}}
do.say.1 [a08f53] = {month == 4 or month == 10: {~考试要来了，人人的羽毛笔都写得更快。|图书馆开到很晚，一直坐满到关门。|你梦见一场没复习过的考试，而没复习过的考试占了大多数。}|{~论文在你桌上越堆越高，像远处压过来的天气。|上课、阅读、更多的阅读。学期自有它的分量。|人人都落后了。走廊里人人都这么说。}}

@hook exhaustion_drain
# en: Running on empty
label [069bc4] = 筋疲力尽
# en: {~You are so tired that the stairs look personal.|Your body has opinions about this month, and none of them are kind.|You fall asleep in a lecture and wake up in a different mood.}
do.say.1 [76f080] = {~你累得连楼梯都像在跟你作对。|你的身体对这个月颇有意见，而且没一条是好话。|你在课上睡着了，醒来时换了一副心情。}

@hook gloom_drain
# en: Gloom
label [0e658b] = 阴郁
# en: {~A grey month. You eat little and sleep badly.|Low spirits sit in your chest like a cold.|The gloom gets into your bones; even the stairs feel steeper.}
do.say.1 [f3af29] = {~灰蒙蒙的一个月。你吃得少，睡得差。|低落的情绪像一场感冒，压在你胸口。|阴郁钻进了骨头里，连楼梯都显得更陡了。}

@hook natural_recovery
# en: Rest
label [e989b7] = 休养
# en: {~A few early nights and a warm meal put some colour back in your face.|You rest, and your body thanks you slowly.|Sleep, soup and a quiet week. You feel more like yourself.}
do.say.1 [91824c] = {~早睡几晚，吃几顿热饭，你的脸上又有了血色。|你好好休息，身体慢慢地道了谢。|睡觉、喝汤、清静的一周。你觉得自己又像自己了。}

@hook fame_fades
# en: Fading gossip
label [06d4e9] = 流言消散
# en: {~The corridors find something else to talk about.|Yesterday's gossip goes the way of yesterday's bread.|Fewer heads turn when you pass. It's restful.}
do.say.1 [5662c0] = {~走廊里找到了别的话题。|昨天的闲话，和昨天的面包一样，没人要了。|你经过时回头的人少了。挺清静的。}

@hook mana_regen
# en: Mana returns
label [d61671] = 法力恢复
# en: {~The magic seeps back into you overnight, like warmth into cold hands.|Your fingertips tingle again by morning.|Whatever you spent, the castle quietly gives some back.}
do.say.1 [27eb51] = {~魔力在夜里一点点渗回你身上，像暖意回到冻僵的手。|到了早上，你的指尖又开始发麻了。|你花掉的，城堡悄悄还回来一些。}

@hook exam_nerves
# en: Exam nerves
label [8b0cdb] = 考前焦虑
# en: {~Exam nerves eat at your magic: your wand hand won't stay still.|Revision drinks your mana before you can cast a thing.}
do.say.1 [90208e] = {~考前的紧张啃食着你的魔力：拿魔杖的手怎么也稳不住。|还没施一个咒，复习就先把你的法力喝光了。}
